# EDU Checking Flow — Implementation Plan (Revised - Hybrid Architecture)

## Strategy

> **Online-first with offline fallback queue**
> - Backend = single source of truth (late detection, session mapping, validation)
> - Hive = temporary offline buffer with retry mechanism
> - Client sends only: `studentId + timestamp` — backend decides everything

