## UX

| Case | UI |
|---|---|
| Online success | Normal result card (name, status, time) |
| Offline fallback | "Đã lưu, sẽ đồng bộ sau" with ⏳ icon |
| Background sync success | Silent |
| Background sync fail | Optional retry indicator |

---

## Key Design Decisions

| Aspect | HRM Checking (old) | EDU Checking (new) |
|---|---|---|
| Storage | Offline-first (Hive) | Hybrid (API + Hive fallback) |
| Sync | Background Workmanager | Direct API + Workmanager retry |
| Session logic | Shift-based (client) | Session-based (backend) |
| Late detection | Client-side | Backend only |
| Face recognition | FaceNative (offline) | Same |
| Offline support | Full | Queue-based fallback |

